@startuml

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
' Shared Actor Definitions for ReSys.Shop Use Case Diagrams
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

' ─── Primary Actors (Human) ──────────────────────────────────

actor "Customer" as Customer
actor "Guest" as Guest  
actor "Administrator" as Admin

' ─── Secondary Actors (External Systems) ─────────────────────

actor "Payment\nGateway" as PaymentGW << System >>
actor "Shipping\nProvider" as ShippingSys << System >>
actor "Email\nService" as EmailSys << System >>
actor "ML Service\n(Python)" as MLService << System >>

' ─── Actor Generalizations ───────────────────────────────────

' Customer inherits from Guest (authenticated user)
Guest <|-- Customer

@enduml
